**/.claude/settings.local.json

# stray expo prebuild at the repo root
# The mobile app lives in apps/mobile (bundle id com.heimursaga.app, its own
# eas.json + app.config.ts). Running `expo prebuild` from the repo root instead
# generates a ~1GB ios/ named after the root package ("with-docker"), which is
# junk. Root-anchored so apps/mobile/ios stays tracked.
/ios/
/.expo/
